---

---

<!-- Bento grid -->
<section id="quickstart" class="px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--container-max)]">
    <div data-reveal class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="hx-eyebrow mb-3">03 / What you get</p>
      <h2 class="hx-title">Install the core. Build from there.</h2>
      <p class="hx-lead mt-5">Start in an existing TypeScript project, or use the CLI to scaffold a new one. You need Node.js 20 or later and npm.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hx-bento mt-12">
      <article data-reveal class="hx-glass hx-tilt hx-span-2 hx-row-2 flex flex-col p-7">
        <i class="bi bi-diagram-3 hx-pop text-3xl text-[var(--color-primary)]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3 class="hx-pop mt-5 text-2xl font-bold">Explicit dependency injection</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--text-muted)]">Register services and their lifetimes in the application builder, without decorator metadata.</p>
        <pre class="hx-pop-lg mt-auto overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-[var(--glass-border)] bg-[var(--bg-primary)]/70 p-4 text-xs leading-6 text-[var(--text-code)]"><code>services.addScoped(
  'ORDER_SERVICE',
  () =&gt; new OrderService()
)</code></pre>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal class="hx-glass hx-tilt p-6">
        <i class="bi bi-signpost-split hx-pop text-2xl text-[var(--color-primary)]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3 class="hx-pop mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">CQRS</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">Commands, queries and handlers keep use cases out of HTTP routes.</p>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal class="hx-glass hx-tilt p-6">
        <i class="bi bi-shield-check hx-pop text-2xl text-[var(--color-primary)]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3 class="hx-pop mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Pipelines</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">Validate every request once with a Zod schema per intent.</p>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal class="hx-glass hx-tilt p-6">
        <i class="bi bi-check2-circle hx-pop text-2xl text-[var(--color-primary)]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3 class="hx-pop mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Result values</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">Carry outcomes back to the controller without mixing in errors.</p>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal class="hx-glass hx-tilt p-6">
        <i class="bi bi-broadcast hx-pop text-2xl text-[var(--color-primary)]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3 class="hx-pop mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Request context</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">AsyncLocalStorage carries identity to downstream work.</p>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal class="hx-glass hx-tilt hx-span-2 flex items-center gap-5 p-6">
        <span class="hx-pop flex h-14 w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-[var(--glass-border)] text-2xl text-[var(--color-primary)]"><i class="bi bi-window" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Full-stack Vue integration</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">Use application composition, commands and queries in Vue.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal class="hx-glass hx-tilt hx-span-2 p-6">
        <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]"><span>terminal</span><span>npm</span></div>
        <pre class="hx-pop overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-[var(--glass-border)] bg-[var(--bg-primary)]/70 p-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-main)]"><code><span class="text-[var(--color-primary)]">$</span> npm install @xeno-js/core</code></pre>
        <a href="/docs/getting_started/installation" class="hx-link mt-2">Open the installation guide <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>